            <ul class="grid gap-3.5 text-[18px]" aria-label="What you get">
              {["One project, all the way to launch", "The full Level 1 learning path", "Readiness checks on your own repo", "Works with your own AI tool and cloud accounts"].map((t) => (
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3.5">
